==Problem 20==

Quadrilateral <imath>ABCD</imath> is a trapezoid, <imath>AD = 15</imath>, <imath>AB = 50</imath>, <imath>BC = 20</imath>, and the altitude is <imath>12</imath>. What is the area of the trapezoid?

<asy>
pair A,B,C,D;
A=(3,20);
B=(35,20);
C=(47,0);
D=(0,0);
draw(A--B--C--D--cycle);
dot((0,0));
dot((3,20));
dot((35,20));
dot((47,0));
label("A",A,N);
label("B",B,N);
label("C",C,S);
label("D",D,S);
draw((19,20)--(19,0));
dot((19,20));
dot((19,0));
draw((19,3)--(22,3)--(22,0));
label("12",(21,10),E);
label("50",(19,22),N);
label("15",(1,10),W);
label("20",(41,12),E);</asy>

<imath> \textbf{(A) }600\qquad\textbf{(B) }650\qquad\textbf{(C) }700\qquad\textbf{(D) }750\qquad\textbf{(E) }800 </imath>


